    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d434">

                <pb facs="0454" n="356" xml:id="pg356"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.003/240: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Perkins</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-01-02T17:00:00+08:00">January 2, 1930—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received January 3—10:55 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>6. Legation’s 1204, December 30, 5 p.m.,<anchor n="36" xml:id="d434-f1"/>
                    paragraph 2. British Minister left today for Nanking to initiate negotiations
                    having as their aim the gradual relinquishment of British extraterritorial
                    rights.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Perkins</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
